WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:07.728
Some things in life are so close, we forget they can be taken away.

00:00:07.728 --> 00:00:09.585
Until one day, they are gone.

00:00:09.585 --> 00:00:15.118
And the world feels impossibly big.

00:00:15.118 --> 00:00:16.012
He searches.

00:00:16.012 --> 00:00:22.657
Through every path, every sound, every memory.

00:00:22.657 --> 00:00:24.152
And then, there it is.

00:00:24.152 --> 00:00:31.000
The precious thing you thought was lost, standing right in front of you.
